@startuml

title Queue-Based Load Leveling: a peak waits in a queue

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "2,000 firings\nin one minute" as src
participant "reporting\n(admission)" as adm
database "queued instances" as q
participant "the run pipeline" as run

src -> adm : 2,000 triggers
adm -> run : start up to the quota
adm -> q : the rest born queued
loop as runs finish
  run -> adm : a run of tenant T ends
  adm -> q : promote the oldest of T
  adm -> run : start it
end
note over src, run : the pipeline runs at its own rate;\nthe peak becomes a wait a person can see
@enduml
